                "content": "LANDSCAPE SYSTEMS (10 visible):\n- workday.hcm: HCM - compensation agents only, NO REST API for staffing data\n- sap.sf: SuccessFactors HCM - REST API: EmployeeCompensationManagement:v1. KEY AGENTS:\n  * SkillsAndCapabilityMatchingOrchestrator:v1 - workforce skills analysis & training recommendations\n  * PerformanceReviewCycleCoordinator:v1\n  * CompensationPolicyAutomationEngine:v1\n- sap.s4: ERP - MaterialReceiptInboundAPI, Procurement agents, OpportunityToOrderAutomationEngine\n  * AssetLifecycleChangeOrchestrator:v1 - TRACKS ASSET LIFECYCLE from inception through implementation\n  * ProcurementMatchingAgent:v1 - analyzes vendor master data (agent, NOT data API)\n- sap.crm: CRM - CAMPAIGN ENGAGEMENT TRACKING & MANAGEMENT:\n  * CampaignAudienceOptimizationCoordinator:v1 - ORCHESTRATES campaign execution\n  * CampaignAudienceOptimizationAgent:v1 - analyzes customer segments & real-time engagement metrics\n- sap.ehs: Safety/health - KEY AGENTS:\n  * IncidentRootCauseAnalyzer:v1 - ANALYZES SAFETY INCIDENTS & TRENDS\n  * IncidentResponseCoordinator:v1\n  * SafetyComplianceAutomationCoordinator:v1\n- sap.ariba: Procurement - **PRIMARY FOR VENDOR MASTER DATA**:\n  * **PurchaseOrderNetworkAPI:v1 (REST) - EXPOSES VENDOR & PURCHASEORDER ENTITIES with specifications, enables procurement team order processing, validates vendor compliance for orders**\n  * VendorInvoiceReconciliationAutomation:v1 - 3-way matching (PO/Receipt/Invoice validation)\n  * SupplierComplianceAndIncidentMonitor:v1 - HAZMAT tracking & SAFETY CERTIFICATIONS\n  * MaterialAndEngineeringChangeCoordinator:v1\n  * SourceingCampaignAndAccountManagementAPI:v1\n- corp.itsm: IT service mgmt - AGENTS ONLY:\n  * IncidentRootCauseAnalyzer:v1 - processes EXISTING service tickets (NOT API for submission)\n  * ChangeAutomationOrchestrator:v1 - coordinates engineering changes\n  * NO REST API for technician maintenance request submission\n- emarsys.cx: CX/marketing - agents ONLY\n- my.mes: Manufacturing:\n  * EquipmentOEEAnalytics (REST API) - machine performance metrics only\n  * ProductionQualityMonitor - quality inspection monitoring\n  * ProductionChangeOrchestrator:v1\n  * SupplierQualityComplianceOrchestrator:v1 - PROCESSES INCOMING MATERIAL INSPECTIONS\n- siemens.plm: PLM:\n  * BOMComplianceValidator:v1 - VALIDATES BOM against regulatory standards\n  * SupplierQualificationAndMaterialCoordinator:v1 - SUPPLIER QUALIFICATION & MATERIAL APPROVAL (design-time)\n  * EngineeringChangeAndMaterialProvisioning:v1\n- sap.odm: Data model (entity taxonomy only)\n\nMAINTENANCE REQUEST SUBMISSION: NO REST API in landscape - corp.itsm has agents that process tickets but no exposed API for technicians to submit maintenance requests\n"
